id: the-mightiest-fusion
name: The Mightiest Fusion
# A Fusion Modifier: chosen as a Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs), never picked by hand. Its Prerequisite is shown there, never enforced.
fusionModifier: true
description: >
  By knowing each other inside and out due to their intense rivalry, your Fused Characters are able to cover each others’ weaknesses, creating the strongest warrior possible.
text: >
  The Mightiest Fusion: By knowing each other inside and out due to their intense rivalry, your Fused Characters are able to cover each others’ weaknesses, creating the strongest warrior possible.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: This Fusion was created with 2 Fused Characters and those Fused Characters have declared the other Fused Character as their ‘Rival’ through the first effect of the Chosen Rival Talent.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Tier of Power by 1 (see — Breakthrough).
  (3)-[Passive]: This Fusion is its own Rival, and benefits from the second and third effects of the Chosen Rival Talent.

---

[passive]
# (2) "see - Breakthrough": never more than two above its base Tier.
tierOfPower += 1;
# (3) Its own Rival, wherever a Rival is asked for (effects/conditions.mjs rivalOf) - Chosen Rival's second and third effects with it.
allow fusion.ownRival;
